sequenceDiagram
  participant Trig as Trigger
  participant U as unattended.py
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant J as pytest plus judge
  participant D as code_implementer
  participant Disk as state.json and receipt
  participant Human as Human
  Trig->>U: dispatch, pull_request, or cron
  U->>Disk: load_state
  U->>O: run fixer
  O->>J: contract.run test
  alt suite green
    O-->>U: PASS
  else same failing ids twice
    O-->>U: ESCALATE with comment
  else budget spent
    O-->>U: ESCALATE with comment
  else retry
    O->>D: repair inside scope
    D-->>O: wrote
    O->>J: contract.run test
  end
  U->>Disk: save_state
  U-->>Human: exit 0, 2, or 1
